as/8c729bb7ae68e31d64cc2eae0bf27446.poster.avif?t=1760394437\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/8c729bb7ae68e31d64cc2eae0bf27446.webm?t=1760394437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/8c729bb7ae68e31d64cc2eae0bf27446.mp4?t=1760394437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Creator Mode </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of the Creator - design your own quests, build intricate dungeons, and shape adventures for others to explore. Play, share, and discover community-made quests from players around the world, or craft your own original challenges to test the bravest heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/9f71e8b38ac1bc5a5cc037f8f6618900.poster.avif?t=1760394437\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/9f71e8b38ac1bc5a5cc037f8f6618900.webm?t=1760394437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/9f71e8b38ac1bc5a5cc037f8f6618900.mp4?t=1760394437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Brain Seal Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/header.jpg?t=1760394437","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><